  title: 'Warning: Self-Report Data Mismatch'
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54bf09c5b5fdced4fb15b8f856b441f3, type: 2}
  mailText: 'Greetings,


    Due to increasingly frequent discrepancies between
    the self-rating of employees in the <b>MARKETING SERVICE</b> and our own recorded
    data, we will now require you to systematically verify <b>H.E.A.L.T.H.</b> values
    from that particular service with the employee <b>DATABASE</b>.


    Sincerely,


    <b>Nurturing
    Service Direction</b>'
